{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/r6t1mw503rjuxqh7goey77j082xeovc.mp3","text":"现在是换班时间，博士，不必在意我，请继续工作吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/pzpuxlaxucmxw3u2gpyt2npjv1qu9w6.mp3","text":"在BSW我被任命为生化防护响应专员——通称“BPRS”。是的，就是大家都熟悉的那种形象，穿着像桶一样的全套防化服......","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/7nqw3nc13wxrlh6ms23d6yhjbd9n84e.mp3","text":"什么？我有洁癖？呵呵，博士出乎意料地很敢说话呢，有胆量哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/57/s652f3r86pnsx1jxqunbddfrezxpwn1.mp3","text":"我认为部分干员的房间最好被净化下，比如那位高高在上的优等生小姐的，您觉得怎么样？","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/59/d5va9zpwqs4aivpr03slyq73fkonn77.mp3","text":"想欣赏下我这把剑的精致花纹吗？那么，请好好地拿着，绝对不要松手，接下来它会在三秒钟内加热到2500度......呵呵，开玩笑的啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/64/fw1sotc4fr7bkxg5kt2k6bqrj2wl815.mp3","text":"请注意那些布满化学烟雾、有毒物质和有害辐射的房间......对，我确实在说凯尔希医生的实验室。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/38qq5rgg1rmvoihq2rvlmfp009gn6zb.mp3","text":"生化防护的相关心得？这个嘛，比如说饭后一定要刷牙？","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/79/7ejs9155bv9m80bnvz3uof0709f3rmk.mp3","text":"雷蛇晋升后的姿态真是惹眼啊。「我这么好看！打这儿，打这儿！」，她一定是想这么说的吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/ey3z0tmexvut0pjqsoxk310sbr1lal4.mp3","text":"啊啊，如果罗德岛这么自由的话，干脆就从黑钢辞职好了~不过这样雷蛇会很伤心呢~","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/dejxav2fjw37f9541ujzf4xn6f2x6a4.mp3","text":"你手腕上停了只蚊子，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/1c4uutdk53r2cl7k1046brqfqs2rpxf.mp3","text":"防化干员芙兰卡，为了最大限度抑制矿石带来的污染，就让我贡献一份力量吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/pv3fjn0ryovwq2a3aq3z88p8e024xjl.mp3","text":"这样的技巧，无论什么样的场合里我都能灵活运用哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/hupwngxm7dohbatc5b7yogoelisusab.mp3","text":"哦，晋升？比起黑钢，这里要有趣多了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/lshhrnf6uhesstxipwvjkvb55tal0d5.mp3","text":"哼哼，你想见识下这把剑最闪耀的样子吗？遗憾，现在的博士还没有那个资格。再努力点，也许那一天会到来的哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/cqoi13efbwnnp9e5gtx8qyavlj3qma2.mp3","text":"好，准备完毕。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/jkw9sc1zlf7aprfnixctue3v40ii0yk.mp3","text":"培养优秀部下的好处，就是能把麻烦事统统推给他们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/1mh5gdwt860j3jahj38yb2im8ta86m3.mp3","text":"那么，我们出发。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/i5j7wf596ay5n5u6uqd669p1mljc7h7.mp3","text":"很遗憾，这些人已经被污染了，那样的话......","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/bxucs0lrdefg49n46gtli0iqv4e8kgd.mp3","text":"时间有限。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/ijccesv6vtgjn2vj2bgrrby6fcv5xyt.mp3","text":"没时间犹豫了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/k6mjm5nwjnvkh8babjx48fds7mjkfe8.mp3","text":"我对进攻不怎么在行~","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/75/7b3pk0bqx2rpa6rzzwz1ur7i1ame8mw.mp3","text":"重装甲好可怕......骗你的~","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/r3kexpd2yhfc5781sb85yh8tgwba0xj.mp3","text":"发现你的弱点了～","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/98/3smkmwh7ccrapeiw3z0lbzdkuraoa40.mp3","text":"烧起来吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/1re0rfqw3nse34l6xpvek59cuoafwis.mp3","text":"停止呼吸咯～","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/a37yb3fx327bejmkfg4kcc25sfvbcx2.mp3","text":"骗~你的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/aj48idwywfwlhmq78igyp5v34u5mna2.mp3","text":"沉溺于力量，是最愚蠢的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/qmhgjtg5a5uai9oia3hm9cm68gpiysu.mp3","text":"真是一次完美的行动，做的很好哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/ijs13x5npiwo3ankuqnejf8443099n9.mp3","text":"理所当然的结果。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/5mm3e1bstbndd56ntcc5ifjxf7uu92q.mp3","text":"在这种地方沮丧又有什么用？立刻撤退。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/igvs2lp1egsnvzufxba9j9bxkv2nr07.mp3","text":"没有红茶吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/72x9lwiqbd28gpgf5l5j1plds0ok5sy.mp3","text":"有事？","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/7chqrwg5qiu2bevl5azbfpk0i8ctovl.mp3","text":"我们在黑钢时的事，想了解了解吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/oq9h8utzf1jx3jcotg5x3ivz22ve2hj.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/tni6up5eobz4rslaqgbr13aekh8x9xk.mp3","text":"喔，年终奖金到手了！谢谢你，博士。我会把这当作对我的认可，今年我会更加努力的！有什么艰难的任务就尽管派给我吧！（好，接下来再去黑钢领一份......）","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/pyvduyhxbgwtt5f061dh7ognw7ofi9m.mp3","text":"博士，早安。","alt":"voice_cn/char_106_franka/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/7bnczokavot8ceht8xus1h47pv5tw7q.mp3","text":"现在是换班时间，博士，不必在意我，请继续工作吧。","alt":"voice/char_106_franka/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/31/1hqp6yirs5rg95ejr14uc2j5rcna6p5.mp3","text":"在BSW我被任命为生化防护响应专员——通称“BPRS”。是的，就是大家都熟悉的那种形象，穿着像桶一样的全套防化服......","alt":"voice/char_106_franka/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/71/o3q3gklfmm8f39or8kwu84kslctmd3t.mp3","text":"什么？我有洁癖？呵呵，博士出乎意料地很敢说话呢，有胆量哦。","alt":"voice/char_106_franka/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/22uxg6tqr2hnlkupystyqiaowq6gp5p.mp3","text":"我认为部分干员的房间最好被净化下，比如那位高高在上的优等生小姐的，您觉得怎么样？","alt":"voice/char_106_franka/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/qrfjw841lm1u7a04a3k7kwyu2lly6j8.mp3","text":"想欣赏下我这把剑的精致花纹吗？那么，请好好地拿着，绝对不要松手，接下来它会在三秒钟内加热到2500度......呵呵，开玩笑的啦。","alt":"voice/char_106_franka/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/75/k1ixie3bpccb09lvm8z4hnbjuxwnmg2.mp3","text":"请注意那些布满化学烟雾、有毒物质和有害辐射的房间......对，我确实在说凯尔希医生的实验室。","alt":"voice/char_106_franka/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/sqjnd7yi7pdvlezx0n